<title>USA: Genetics Institute surges on buyout news.</title>
<headline>Genetics Institute surges on buyout news.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Genetics Institute Inc soared 37 percent after American Home Products Corp announced it would exercise its option to buy the 40 percent of Genetics Institute it did not already own.</p>
<p>Genetics Institute shares jumped 22-3/4 to 84-1/2, just shy of American Home's $85 per share option exercise price.</p>
<p>Shares in American Home Products rose 3/8 to 59-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
